\\text{d}x & =\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={log}_{4}⁡(2x)\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{3{x}^{3}})-\\int (-\\frac{1}{3{x}^{3}})(\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡4})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{{log}_{4}⁡(2x)}{3{x}^{3}}+\\frac{1}{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{4}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{{log}_{4}⁡(2x)}{3{x}^{3}}+\\frac{1}{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}(-\\frac{1}{3{x}^{3}})+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)}{3{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}-\\frac{1}{9{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)+1}{9{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an integral constant.\n\nNote that in the above calculation we used the change of base formula ${log}_{4}⁡(2x)=\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}.$" 13194139534636 true] [17592186300070 1000 #edb/ref 17592186300071 13194139534636 true] [17592186300070 1000 #edb/ref 17592186300072 13194139534636 true] [17592186300070 1000 #edb/ref 17592186300073 13194139534636 true] [17592186300070 1000 #edb/ref 17592186300074 13194139534636 true] [17592186300070 1000 #edb/ref 17592186300075 13194139534636 true] [17592186300070 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534636 true] [17592186300070 1041 "selection" 13194139534636 true] [17592186300070 1104 #edb/ref 17592186300071 13194139534636 true] [17592186300070 1110 #uuid "eeb504cb-d712-53f5-9c85-be74cc3f59eb" 13194139534636 true] [17592186300071 1034 "-\\frac{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)+1}{9{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}+C" 13194139534636 true] [17592186300071 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534636 true] [17592186300071 1111 #uuid "19e32fa8-90ab-5f78-a1da-cf421141cb00" 13194139534636 true] [17592186300072 1034 "-\\frac{6\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)-1}{9{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}+C" 13194139534636 true] [17592186300072 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534636 true] [17592186300072 1111 #uuid "8193345e-f5e5-5582-9492-3d0696344172" 13194139534636 true] [17592186300073 1034 "-\\fra